            <div xml:id="d786">

                <pb facs="0965" n="957" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg957"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.9411/138</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Navy Department to the Department of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-04-17">April 17, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The following message was received from the Naval Attaché at Ankara this
                    date:</p>
                <p>[Paraphrase] When explaining the Japanese-Russian pact, the Russian Naval Attaché
                    said that the Russian policy is clear and that it is to allow everyone else to
                    fight while Russia fights with no one.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
